s8: $ G , v ∊ ω , v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v , w = suc v , w ∊ cdm g , w ∊ cdm h ⇒ cdm h = suc j $ by weaken [#6]
s9: $ G , v ∊ ω , v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v , w = suc v , w ∊ cdm g , w ∊ cdm h ⇒ ∀ k (k ∊ j → fv h (suc k) = fv F (fv h k)) $ by weaken [#8]
s10: $ G , v ∊ ω , v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v , w = suc v , w ∊ cdm g , w ∊ cdm h ⇒ w ∊ cdm h $ by ax
