s16: $ G , v ∊ ω , v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v , w = suc v , w ∊ cdm g , w ∊ cdm h ⇒ v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v $ by ax
