s33: $ … ⇒ v ∊ ω → (v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v) → suc v ∈ {x | x ∊ cdm g → x ∊ cdm h → fv g x = fv h x} $ by imp_intro [s32]
s34: $ … ⇒ ∀ v (v ∊ ω → (v ∊ cdm g → v ∊ cdm h → fv g v = fv h v) → suc v ∈ {x | x ∊ cdm g → x ∊ cdm h → fv g x = fv h x}) $ by all_intro [s33]
